                  "name": "CC stuff example",
                  "text": "# Gyro Behavior\nREAL_WORLD_CALIBRATION = 10\nIN_GAME_SENS = 10\nACCEL_CURVE = natural \nMIN_GYRO_SENS = 5.01\nMAX_GYRO_SENS = 5\nDECEL_BRAKE_STRENGTH = 0.26\nDECEL_BRAKE_THRESHOLD = 33.84\nGYRO_CUTOFF_SPEED = 0.81\nGYRO_CUTOFF_RECOVERY = 6.96\nGYRO_SMOOTH_TIME = 0.14\nGYRO_SMOOTH_THRESHOLD = 14.09\nGYRO_ANGLE_SNAP = 3.11\n\n\n# Stick bindings\nLUP = W\nLDOWN = S\nLLEFT = A\nLRIGHT = D\n\n"
